{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2022-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1642982400, "end_date": 1643673599, "month_true_total": 78, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:51:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "109178158", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997347262", "personaname": "brandonopoly101", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197997347262/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 1297, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 255, "last_played": 1713671400, "avatar": "ff54d8e8bc4a8eae72c71defb2131d1c29d5162c"}, "language": "english", "review": "huge fan of EFD so lets get into it. \nThe reason why wing divers have skimpy outfits is  because clothes drag them down it's supposed to be funny. \nThe game feels like 4.1, but more polished and runs smoother. \nThe maps are not the same, i ran into rice fields, and some other things not in 4.1. If you mean the maps are flat with buildings then yeah. I think some buildings might be the same idk. They look similar.  \nThis one has main characters that can't die, like the sergeant that's always trying to find you a safe place they just get knocked unconscious. \nThe games supposed to be goofy idk why people trying to make the wing diver more realistic by giving her clothes that ruins the lore.  \nIs it worth 60 bucks? Idk, depends if you're gonna clock alot of hours into it. \nIt's 4.1, but slight tweaks like sprinting and enemy damage and upgrading weapons. The game has always been grindy. \nIs there negatives? I don't play online with randoms I play with friends. If you wanna play without a hacker I'll play. Idk if there is hackers or not i barley play with randoms, but if there is randoms might not be good. \nI recommend this over 4.1, but if you don't wanna spend 60 then definitely get 4.1 cause you're gonna get the same experience.", "timestamp_created": 1643634337, "timestamp_updated": 1643634337, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109157442", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043978505", "personaname": "Darthshellious", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043978505/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3997, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1049, "last_played": 1654919764, "avatar": "fc3611d1ef2057783a85baa77bb1bcdf5bec3787"}, "language": "english", "review": "this is fun!", "timestamp_created": 1643604671, "timestamp_updated": 1643604671, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109136178", "author": {"steamid": "76561198259987619", "personaname": "TheBajaBlaster", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198259987619/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 12705, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12188, "last_played": 1690421525, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDF!!!", "timestamp_created": 1643577034, "timestamp_updated": 1643577034, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "rea